Do iMatches.$define(match,remove,uuid)
Calculate iFillTint as kTrue
Calculate iStrokeTint as kTrue
Calculate iPreviewColor as rgb(210,55,65)
Do iColors.$define(label,color)
Do iColors.$add('Rosso',rgb(210,55,65))
Do iColors.$add('Blu',rgb(35,95,210))
Do iColors.$add('Verde',rgb(30,155,85))
Do iColors.$add('Viola',rgb(150,65,200))
Do iColors.$add('Nero',rgb(0,0,0))
Do iColors.$add('Grigio',rgb(130,130,130))
Calculate iColors.$line as 1
Calculate iLoaded as kFalse
Calculate iStatus as 'Seleziona o trascina un file SVG per iniziare.'

Do method RedrawPreview